    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "```js\n// hooks/log-edit.js\nlet raw = \"\";\nprocess.stdin.on(\"data\", (c) => (raw += c));\nprocess.stdin.on(\"end\", () => {\n  const evt = JSON.parse(raw);\n  const file = evt.tool_input?.file_path;\n  const line = `${new Date().toISOString()}\\t${evt.tool_name}\\t${file}\\n`;\n  require(\"fs\").appendFileSync(require(\"path\").join(process.env.HOME, \".hc-edits.log\"), line);\n});\n```\n\nPrint `raw` once to a temp file first to confirm the field names in your version."
     ]
    },
